	Name: "Quest Acquired!",
	Icon: "Quests/Richard",
	Description: "<span style=\"color:DarkTurquoise\">Arthur</span> and <span style=\"color:DarkTurquoise\">Richard</span> have invited you on a Stargazing date this weekend. They told you to meet them at the <span style=\"color:Teal\">Woods</span> near <span style=\"color:Teal\">Wald Street</span> on <span style=\"color:Teal\">Saturday</span> around <span style=\"color:Teal\">8PM</span>.",
})>>
<<socialChange "Richard" 3 1>>
<<socialChange "Arthur" 3 1>>
